[I] A small collection of useful tools for IPv6 networking

[T] NDisc6 gathers a few diagnostic tools for IPv6 networks: ndisc6 and
[T] rdisc6 for ICMPv6 neighbor and router discovery in userland, several
[T] traceroute implementations such as rltraceroute6 and tcptraceroute6,
[T] tcpspray6 and the rdnssd DNS server discovery daemon.

[U] https://www.remlab.net/ndisc6

[A] Ndisc6 Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

